    %% Frontend connections
    Pages --> DL
    DL --> Sidebar & Header
    Pages --> useApi
    useApi --> ApiClient
    Auth --> ApiClient
    Header -->|"polls /notifications/unread-count\nevery 10s"| ApiClient

    %% Frontend to Backend
    ApiClient -->|"REST API\nHTTP + Bearer JWT"| CORS

    %% Backend flow
    CORS --> JWTMw --> RBAC --> Routers
    Routers --> Services
    Services --> Models
    Models -->|"SQLAlchemy ORM"| DB
    R2 --> StaticFiles
